category: Libs
requires: cygwin liblcm1 python312
sdesc: "Lightweight Communications and Marshalling (python3 bindings)"
ldesc: "LCM is a set of libraries and tools for message passing and data marshalling,
targeted at real-time systems where high-bandwidth and low latency are
critical. It provides a publish/subscribe message passing model and automatic
marshalling/unmarshalling code generation with bindings for applications in a
variety of programming languages. It was originally designed and used by the
MIT DARPA Urban Challenge Team as its message passing system."
external-source: lcm

